# | cpu.patch
# | Description: Drops two stray "*/" lines so the vendored core compiles, and adds the harness's hooks: register and memory accessors, an SFR write callback (ext_sfr_w) and timer event skipping for the idle schedule.
# | Author: suinevere
# | Dependencies: cpu.c, cpu.h
# | Globals: m_pc, m_mram, m_sfr, m_vtrbf, m_xram, m_irq_flag, m_timer0, m_timer1, m_timer0_prescaler, m_base_timer
# | Params: N/A
# | Returns: N/A
#----------------------
